From d58c6231c30ab722df0f5c0a14aee7cad29ea1ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:55:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/32] Plugins: every plugin this build ships installs from
 Available

The original's plugins the build ships to run where installed could only
be installed from the catalog; a test plugin (a .test folder: the original
publishes it in a second catalog that only meters from 2.0.78 read) not at
all. Now Available lists every plugin of this build that doesn't run, the
removed ones and the original's not installed, tagged "Clicktrough", in
place of the catalog's entry for it. Install runs this build's copy without
a download (dpsMeter.ctPluginsAdded); Remove takes it away again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBQati3x8VviBbpY9juEWf
---
 public/src/js/pluginSettings.js |  9 ++--
 src-tauri/src/plugins/mod.rs    | 73 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 64 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/src/js/pluginSettings.js b/public/src/js/pluginSettings.js
